### 🔄 상품 등록 (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nameKr": "한글 상품명",
  "nameEng": "English Product Name",
  "descriptionKr": "이것은 한국어 설명입니다.",
  "descriptionEng": "This is an English description.",
  "category": "MEN'S",
  "subCategory": "TOP"
}

### 🔍 상품 전체 조회 (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 🔍 상품 단일 조회 (GET by ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/3

### ✏️ 상품 수정 (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nameKr": "수정된 한글 상품명",
  "nameEng": "Updated English Name",
  "descriptionKr": "수정된 한국어 설명입니다.",
  "descriptionEng": "Updated English description.",
  "category": "ACCESSORIES",
  "subCategory": "HATS"
}

### ❌ 상품 삭제 (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/2


